Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:33.63,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess! Princess! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:35.44,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:35.95,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:39.66,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Princess! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:40.42,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.45,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The dead are the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:49.60,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The living can never interact with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:01.55,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Nothing comes of them \Nremaining in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:03.55,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There’s nowhere for them to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.49,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:07.49,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's time for them to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.98,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,That goes for you too, \Ndoesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:32.64,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,You're like me. \NYou also have nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:36.49,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,No, you more than me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:40.20,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,You were planning on dying here, \Nweren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.68,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.43,Main,Kiriya,0,0,0,,Why are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:10.93,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,It's your fault! \NEverything is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.77,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shin!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:19.19,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:24.44,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:29.55,Flashback,Ghosts,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:31.32,Flashback,Ghosts,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.23,Flashback,Ghosts,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.01,Flashback,Ghosts,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.01,0:03:37.02,Flashback,Ghosts,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:40.08,Flashback,Ghosts,0,0,0,,Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.63,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,You don't need to let me \Nhold you back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.08,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,You can just forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:51.72,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:53.69,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:55.99,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:59.73,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Breakfast time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.85,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.00,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:09.08,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.12,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:13.79,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,You have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:18.09,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,Nothing to protect. \NNo place to go home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:19.41,Flashback,Recca,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.97,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,Nothing to wish for. \NNothing to aim for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:21.25,Flashback,Mikuri,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:24.52,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Shin, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:26.85,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,Not even anyone \Nto call out for as you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:30.84,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,Not a single reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.36,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:36.13,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,You were kept alive only \Nso you could kill the Morpho.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:35.24,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:37.99,Flashback,Myna,0,0,0,,Shin, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:39.20,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,So if no place needs you anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.53,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:45.27,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,then there's no reason \Nfor you to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:45.56,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.73,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,No, forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:56.07,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you could remember me, \Njust once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:05:00.49,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,When you're free, \Nwhen you're happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:04.27,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,Just then... \NJust once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:07.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"Free"? "Happy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:09.11,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:11.58,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Not when you left me behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:18.00,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Why does every single one of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.13,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Leave me alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:23.33,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Die before me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:28.99,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,And then tell me that we're the ones \Nwho fight to the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:31.44,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,That that's what makes us \Nwho we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:36.27,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,You were looking for a place to die. \NThat's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:41.48,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,And you took them with you \Non your meaningless journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.39,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:49.92,Flashback,Eugene,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.62,Flashback,Frederica,0,0,0,,Your heart's frozen cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:04.14,Flashback,Frederica,0,0,0,,That's why the warm feelings \Nyou shared with your comrades burn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.98,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,Are they too painful to bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:10.01,Flashback,Anju,0,0,0,,Then we'll take them from you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:12.48,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,Let us help for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:30.29,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,We've left you alone again, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.18,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:34.53,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.02,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:54.24,sign_120_2___MISSING__,Onscreen,0,0,0,,- Time Since Mission Began -
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:47.51,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,You thought it was over, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:52.58,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,You thought it would be over \Nwhen you killed the Morpho, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.21,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No more...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:57.01,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.39,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:00.64,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,now it's just me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:02.69,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Will you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:05.17,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,But to tell the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:07.80,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.94,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,You've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.90,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,This moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:20.86,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I see that you are with\N the San Magnolia Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:33.04,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I am with the Giad Federacy \N177th Mechanized Infantry Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:37.36,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I was conducting Legion elimination operations \Nto support our defense lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:40.64,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you for your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.13,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.29,sign_14130_101_MISSING,Lena,0,0,0,,Why were you in this awful battle alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.99,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:59.70,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,However, my main unit is behind me, \Nand I will be able to rendezvous with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.53,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:12.47,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Our main unit is capable of protecting you, \Nif your numbers aren't too large.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:15.90,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.82,sign_14780_110_MISSING,Onscreen,0,0,0,,I will stay in this country
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.57,sign_14828_111_MISSING,Onscreen,0,0,0,,and continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.07,sign_14881_112_MISSING,Onscreen,0,0,0,,I won't abandon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:25.83,sign_14921_113_MISSING,Onscreen,0,0,0,,Even if I'm not strong enough to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:28.08,sign_15014_114_MISSING,Onscreen,0,0,0,,I will continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:34.32,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Fight? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:37.63,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Are you in a hurry to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.43,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Then you would've done better
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:43.15,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,not to fight at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:53.70,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.71,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,If something happens, \Nmake a run for it, my Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.70,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,Without any kind of protection, \Nyou're just in the way if there's a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:01.42,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:04.42,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,And we don't know that \Nsomething will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:09.23,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,Even if I'm not strong enough to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:12.24,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,I won't embarrass myself \Nby giving up and falling to my knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:17.93,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,I'll keep fighting until\N the very last moment of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:21.10,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,I know people who lived that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:25.31,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,and they believed that I could do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:27.65,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,So we...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.78,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:36.33,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,will fight until I reach them, \Nand until I can take them to what lies ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:45.63,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I am Captain Vladilena Milizé, the commander \Nof the former Republic's Defense Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:49.37,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,And I will never
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.75,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,run from this war!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.36,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:15.90,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Those people died a long time ago, \Ndidn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:18.89,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,What duty do you have to the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:25.63,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They told me not to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:38.20,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They told me about what would happen. \NAbout the Legion's large-scale assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.26,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,And that's how I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:43.77,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They wanted me to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:47.02,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They told me they wanted \Nto see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.46,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,And that's why I can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:51.21,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,So I want to be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.24,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,who they thought
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.22,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.97,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They're gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:05.10,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,But I want to get to where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:08.03,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,To catch up to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.58,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,And this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:15.75,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Fight with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:22.24,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Because... I want to take them \Nbeyond this battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:40.49,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.80,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,You're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:47.63,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,You fought to the end. \NYou survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:49.04,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,That's why you're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:57.26,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I think that's something \Nyou should be more proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:16.49,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:20.26,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Major, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:46.99,Italics,Richard,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:49.98,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,Your Highness, this ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:52.59,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,I just got word \Nfrom the guys at the Gran Mur.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.73,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,There's Legion heading toward us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.77,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:14:57.96,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Federacy soldier, come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:58.71,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:18.14,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.41,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:21.53,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Cyclops?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:24.21,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,You didn't see it? \NThat marking...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:26.03,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,That's the Giad Empire's mark, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:27.76,Main,Shiden,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.52,Main,Shiden,0,0,0,,Oh, right…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:33.14,Main,Shiden,0,0,0,,I guess there’s no way \Nyou could've ever seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:39.84,Main,Richard,0,0,0,,Good work, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:42.77,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.95,Italics,Grethe,0,0,0,,You okay, Lieutenant Nouzen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:47.41,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:49.47,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:51.35,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:53.81,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:57.67,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,If you've finished your mission, \Nit's your job to give me a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:15:59.47,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:03.60,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,This time, the others gave me the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.18,0:16:06.96,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,There were survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:09.95,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:11.03,Italics,Anju & Theo,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:11.94,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:16.76,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Listen, that should’ve been \Nthe first thing you asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:20.63,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Really. Kurena was bawling\N her eyes out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:22.62,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,She said you were the only one \Nshe couldn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.58,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,This is the second time \Nyou've made her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:28.20,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,You need to stop being so reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:29.50,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:32.77,Italics,Bernholdt,0,0,0,,Commander, don't just \Nwrite us off for dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:34.33,Italics,All,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:37.26,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,You got blown away \Nand stopped moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:39.04,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,So we thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:41.47,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,We were a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:46.23,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,So, miraculously, the whole unit's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.98,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Nobody left you behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:02.66,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Good work, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:06.37,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You're still around, Ernst?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:11.15,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm just worried about my son! \NDo you have to be so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.93,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,I'm the supreme commander \Nof the allied armies, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:16.73,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I be around?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:23.43,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Our advance teams tell me \Nyou've already made contact,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:26.11,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,but after this operation ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:29.78,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Federacy forces will begin a rescue operation \Nin former San Magnolia territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:33.11,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Autonomous units intercepted transmissions \Nfrom within the Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:34.76,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,and the three nations \Nmade the decision jointly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.46,0:17:38.15,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,If another Morpho is ever made,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:43.29,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,it would be a serious threat if it was able \Nto hide in highly-defended Republic territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.61,0:17:44.52,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:50.24,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,It would be unethical to know \Nthere were survivors and leave them to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.33,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,To the Federacy, they are comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:57.32,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,This is a rescue operation, \Nthe same as what we did for you Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.57,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,We're glad to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:02.25,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,But it's not a home \Nyou want to go back to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:05.16,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,If you don't want to fight \Nfor the sake of your oppressors,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:07.83,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,we'll let you head back \Nwhen we advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:11.02,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No, we'll remain with the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:14.28,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I have no desire \Nto save the Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.89,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,but there are people there \Nwho I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:21.11,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:24.67,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,What will happen \Nto the Republic forces I just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.07,0:18:27.96,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Our helicopters will take\N them to the Gran Mur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.89,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Escort helis will protect them \Nif they run into Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.29,0:18:34.66,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,So let our advance teams take over \Nwhile you rest for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:40.82,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,And Frederica, you're in for one hell \Nof a punishment when you get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:43.31,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'll throw her in a container \Nor something and send her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:46.94,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei? You're betraying me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.09,Italics,Ernst,0,0,0,,Thanks, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:55.51,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm not heading home even after \Nwe meet up with the main unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:58.99,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't need a hostage anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.58,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.29,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:07.90,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:10.88,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:37.60,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,But... I'm sorry. \NThe gun you gave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.05,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:43.14,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,In the end, it was just an excuse \Nto go back to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:47.92,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're still carrying them, \Nevery single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.19,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,How is it an excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.25,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.73,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're a softie, Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:00.61,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You didn't want \Nto give her your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.27,0:20:05.44,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,She was your commander \Nwhen you were in the Republic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.35,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I never told you about the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.85,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Did you forget my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:13.06,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You were eavesdropping?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:16.39,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,When she gave her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:20.26,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,you were so surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:23.89,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,I saw there must be some deep connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.75,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,"Go on ahead," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.15,0:20:31.69,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm glad she caught up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:35.36,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,She's come this far \Nout of respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:39.03,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn't want \Nto give her your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:43.89,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I can't, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.83,0:20:47.23,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,She said she was going \Nto catch up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:52.45,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be right \Nif she caught up with me in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:56.20,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,When she goes forward, what she sees...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.50,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,shouldn't be a battlefield like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.40,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.52,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're such a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:12.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You can be so weirdly stubborn \Nwhen it comes to these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:15.46,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,By the way, did you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:18.29,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You have your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.57,0:21:21.27,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,If she's going forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.27,0:21:23.67,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,there needs to be something for her \Nto see down the path she follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:28.18,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,She follows the path that you create.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:33.43,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,So what is your destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:40.12,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You just found the answer yourself, \Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:22.93,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:29.17,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,They told me not to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.17,0:22:31.17,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,They told me about what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:34.03,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,About the Legion's large-scale assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:35.95,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,And that's how I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:39.00,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,They wanted me to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.91,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,They told me they wanted \Nto see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:45.77,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,And that's why I can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.47,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,So how'd she look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.10,0:22:54.54,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:58.66,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,She didn't know it was you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:22:59.44,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.15,0:23:05.57,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,When did any of us say \Nnot to forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:09.20,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Her voice was different. \NShe sounds bolder now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:11.00,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Of course it's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.53,0:23:15.80,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Just like us, \Nshe fought and survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:19.84,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,So much happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.33,0:23:21.95,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,But I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.99,0:23:24.54,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:25.79,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.79,0:23:29.58,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,She'd be surprised \Nif she knew we were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:32.32,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I wish I could've met her, just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:37.62,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"Handler One."
